{"slug":"ifc","number":"A","title":"IFC4 mapping","sections":[],"blocks":[{"t":"p","c":["This annex maps every Floorspec Core kind to the IFC4 (ADD2 TC1) entity that represents it, and names the relationships that connect them. It is normative as a vocabulary: an exporter that writes a Floorspec kind to IFC uses the class and relationships given here. It doubles as the dictionary between the two vocabularies, which is why it lists derived kinds too."]},{"t":"p","c":["Every exported element carries its Floorspec ID in a property set named ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Identity"}," (property ",{"t":"code","v":"ID"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcIdentifier"},"), so a file exported to IFC, edited in another tool and brought back can be reconciled element by element (FLR-ADR-012)."]},{"t":"table","align":[null,null,null],"head":[["Floorspec"],["IFC4 entity"],["Relationship and notes"]],"rows":[[["Document"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcProject"}],["units in millimetres; the base unit is not an IFC unit, so lengths are converted (÷ 1,280)"]],[["Project"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcProject"}],[{"t":"code","v":"Name"}," = ",{"t":"code","v":"project.name"},"; ",{"t":"code","v":"Description"}," = ",{"t":"code","v":"project.description"}]],[["Site"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcSite"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAggregates"}," (project → site); ",{"t":"code","v":"RefLatitude"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"RefLongitude"}," from ",{"t":"code","v":"location"}," (converted from microdegrees to degrees, minutes, seconds, millionths); ",{"t":"code","v":"trueNorth"}," sets the ",{"t":"code","v":"TrueNorth"}," of the model's geometric context"]],[["Building"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcBuilding"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAggregates"}," (site → building, or project → building when there is no site)"]],[["Level"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcBuildingStorey"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAggregates"}," (building → storey); ",{"t":"code","v":"Elevation"}," = ",{"t":"code","v":"elevation"}]],[["Junction"],["—"],["no entity; the junction graph travels as the ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Graph"}," property set on each wall (",{"t":"code","v":"StartJunction"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"EndJunction"},", and the junction's position) and as ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelConnectsPathElements"}," between walls that share a junction (",{"t":"code","v":"RelatingConnectionType"}," / ",{"t":"code","v":"RelatedConnectionType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"ATSTART"}," or ",{"t":"code","v":"ATEND"},")"]],[["Wall"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcWall"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"STANDARD"},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure"}," (storey → wall); axis representation = location line; body = the derived outline extruded from base to top elevation; ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelDefinesByType"}," → its ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWallType"}]],[["Wall's layers"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcMaterialLayerSetUsage"}," over an ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcMaterialLayerSet"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAssociatesMaterial"},"; layers in the same order (left to right); ",{"t":"code","v":"DirectionSense"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"POSITIVE"},"; ",{"t":"code","v":"OffsetFromReferenceLine"}," from the justification's ",{"t":"code","v":"a"}]],[["Separator"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcVirtualElement"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure"},"; ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelSpaceBoundary"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PhysicalOrVirtualBoundary"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"VIRTUAL"},") to the spaces either side"]],[["Opening"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcOpeningElement"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelVoidsElement"}," (wall → opening); an opening with a fill adds ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcDoor"}," or ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWindow"}," and ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelFillsElement"}," (opening → door or window)"]],[["Door type, window type"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcDoorType"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWindowType"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelDefinesByType"}," → the ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcDoor"}," or ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWindow"}]],[["Room"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcSpace"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"INTERNAL"},", or ",{"t":"code","v":"EXTERNAL"}," for function ",{"t":"code","v":"exterior"},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAggregates"}," (storey → space); ",{"t":"code","v":"Name"}," = ",{"t":"code","v":"name"},"; footprint = the derived room polygon; the room function as ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Room.Function"},"; ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelSpaceBoundary"}," to bounding walls and separators"]],[["Room finishes"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcCovering"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelCoversSpaces"}," (space → covering) for floor and ceiling finishes; ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelCoversBldgElements"}," for a wall finish"]],[["Slab"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcSlab"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"FLOOR"},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure"},"; body = ",{"t":"code","v":"boundary"}," extruded down by ",{"t":"code","v":"thickness"}," from the level's elevation plus ",{"t":"code","v":"offset"}]],[["Wall type"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcWallType"}],["owns the ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcMaterialLayerSet"}]],[["Material"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcMaterial"}],[{"t":"code","v":"color"}," as an ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcSurfaceStyleRendering"},"; texture as ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcImageTexture"}]],[["Asset"],["—"],["carried by the material or extension that uses it; never exported on its own"]],[["Net area (derived)"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcQuantityArea"}," in ",{"t":"code","v":"Qto_SpaceBaseQuantities.NetFloorArea"}],["converted to square metres"]]]}]}
